Multipart requests now carry part metadata through parsing and validation. The validator adds a non-enumerable metadata carrier, validates field-level `encoding.contentType`, decodes JSON parts before AJV, supports practical `form` style/explode cases, and returns structured `PROTOCOL_MISMATCH` diagnostics for invalid or explicitly unsupported multipart encoding combinations in [request-validator.ts](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/mock-server/src/core/request-validator.ts:51) and [request-validator.ts](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/mock-server/src/core/request-validator.ts:302).

MSW and Node HTTP multipart parsers now preserve part metadata for validation in [msw.ts](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/mock-server/src/adapters/msw.ts:231) and [node-http.ts](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/mock-server/src/adapters/node-http.ts:223). Added tests for valid multipart encoding plus invalid content type, malformed JSON part, and unsupported style/explode diagnostics in [validator-body.test.ts](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/mock-server/src/__tests__/unit/validator-body.test.ts:154). Updated [spec.md](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/docs/internal/spec.md), [todo.md](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/docs/internal/todo.md), and appended the required US-019 entry to [.ralph-tui/progress.md](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/.ralph-tui/progress.md).

